{
	"_readme": [
		"CAPTURED FROM THE REAL EDITORS IN A REAL BROWSER, 2026-08-20, not typed by hand.",
		"",
		"Each document below is exactly what `editor.getJSON()` held after pasting HTML",
		"containing a nested list into the shipping component at its dev harness",
		"(/dev/notebook and /dev/classroom-phase1), read back off the ProseMirror view",
		"as `editorDOM.pmViewDesc.node.toJSON()`.",
		"",
		"WHY IT IS COMMITTED. The whole nested-list defect turned on a claim about what",
		"the editor can produce: a sublist is a child of the LIST ITEM above it, never a",
		"sibling of it. Two test files asserted the opposite for two releases. The schema",
		"builder in tests/rich-text-fixtures.ts argues that claim from the schema; this",
		"file is the same claim OBSERVED, so the builder itself has something real to be",
		"checked against. The trailing empty paragraph is the editor's own, kept because",
		"removing it would make this a tidied-up version rather than a capture."
	],
